OL,4,G0232FTech Life
OL,5,     GWe look at how tech and visas
OL,6,     Ghave freed some employees from
OL,7,     Gtheir desktops, allowing them to
OL,8,     Gcontinue their work from other
OL,9,     Gparts of the world. They're
OL,10,     Gcalled digital nomads.
