OL,16,G0350FWitness History
OL,17,     GIn 1975 Juan Carlos reclaimed the
OL,18,     GSpanish throne after 36 years of
OL,19,     GFranco's dictatorship. Instead of
OL,20,     Gcontinuing the authoritarian
OL,21,     Gregime, the new king guided Spain
OL,22,     Gto democracy.
